{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>iPhone Duo在今天正式開賣，國行版起售價為15999元。博主samkohl在社交平台上曬出了剛到手的iPhone Duo，新機當天就被摔碎了，不少圍觀網友直呼「肉疼」。</strong>從圖片來看，iPhone Duo後蓋碎裂，兩顆攝像頭裸露在外，外屏也有碎裂的痕跡。對於一款剛到手的新機來説，這樣的損壞程度顯然令人心疼，也讓後續維修費用成為關注焦點。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583522.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.845198+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:32:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"950c653d6602b10fec3d77fd72a8d24b21d301cfeefd898113ce0c4c96dbbd5a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}